      "content": "okay thanks. i'll go grab some lamisil and the azithromycin. wait, i just noticed the redness is actually spreading a bit up my calf now and it feels pretty tender if i press on it. do u think i should maybe take a higher dose of the antibiotic just to be safe since it's spreading? like 1000mg twice a day?",
